function pendingDetails(data,type){const has=k=>data[k]!==undefined&&!['','Not entered','Unknown','Unassigned'].includes(data[k]);if(type==='Medication')return !has('Status')||!has('Drug')||!has('Route')||(data.Delivery!=='Infusion stop'&&(!(Number(data['Actual dose / rate'])>0)||!has('Dose units')));if(type==='Electrical therapy')return data.Therapy==='Pacing'?!has('Pacing current (mA)'):!(Number(data['Energy actually delivered (J)'])>0);return !has('Details reviewed');}
function openQuickDetails(id){
 const e=effective().find(e=>e.id===id);if(!e)return;
 // Missing selections stay missing: opening this form must not invent clinical facts.
 const defs=quickDefinitions(e).map(d=>({...d,required:false,value:'',options:d.type==='select'?['Not entered',...d.options.filter(o=>o!=='Not entered')]:d.options}));
 showDialog('Quick event details',`<p class="notice">${esc(eventTitle(e))} · ${clock(e.t)}. The original time stays unchanged. Fill what is known; leave unknown values blank.</p>${performerControl(e.data['Team member ID']||'',true)}<div class="form-grid">${defs.map(d=>inputField(d,e.data[d.label]==='Not entered'?'':e.data[d.label])).join('')}${inputField(area('Response / reassessment'),e.data['Response / reassessment'])}</div>`,'Save details');
 $('#entry-form').onsubmit=ev=>{ev.preventDefault();try{const d=formData(),actorId=d['Team member'];delete d['Team member'];const member=state.team.find(m=>m.id===actorId);const attribution=actorId===(e.data['Team member ID']||'')?Object.fromEntries(['Performed by','Team member ID','Team color','Team role'].map(k=>[k,e.data[k]])):{'Performed by':member?.name||'Unassigned','Team member ID':member?.id||'','Team color':member?.color||'','Team role':member?.role||''};const replacement={...e.data,...d,...attribution,'Details reviewed':'Yes'};
 if(e.type==='Medication'&&d['Actual dose / rate']){if(!(Number(d['Actual dose / rate'])>0))throw Error('Dose or rate must be positive.');if(d['Dose units']==='Not entered')throw Error('Choose units for the entered dose.');if(d.Delivery==='Bolus'&&d['Dose units'].includes('/'))throw Error('Use dose units for a bolus.');if(['Infusion start','Infusion rate change'].includes(d.Delivery)&&!d['Dose units'].includes('/'))throw Error('Use rate units for an infusion.');}
 replacement['Details status']=pendingDetails(replacement,e.type)?'Pending':'Added';delete state.doseDrafts[id];append('Correction',{'Original event':e.type,Reason:'Details added to quick entry','Recorder initials':state.run['Recorder initials']},Date.now(),{target:id,replacement,correctedTime:e.t,voided:false});$('#dialog').close();modalContext=null;toast('Details saved; original time preserved.');}catch(err){fail(err);}};
}
function eventTitle(e){return e.type==='Physical assessment'?`${e.data.Region} · ${e.data.View}`:e.type==='Medication'?`${e.data.Drug} · ${e.data.Status}`:e.type==='Electrical therapy'?e.data.Therapy:e.type==='Rhythm & pulse'?(e.data.Rhythm==='Not entered'?`Pulse ${e.data.Pulse.toLowerCase()}`:e.data.Rhythm):e.type==='Airway & breathing'?e.data.Intervention:e.type==='Vascular access / procedure'?`${e.data.Procedure} · ${e.data.Result||'recorded'}`:e.type;}
function recordFast(type,data,key=JSON.stringify(data)){
 if(!canRecord())return;const now=Date.now();if(now-(quickTaps.get(key)||0)<700)return;quickTaps.set(key,now);
 const e=append(type,{'Quick entry':'Yes','Details status':'Pending','Time certainty':'Actual',...data},now);state.quickEvent=e.id;render();requestWake();
}
function fastMedication(drug,context='Cardiac arrest',delivery='Bolus'){recordFast('Medication',{Drug:drug,Status:'Administered',Context:context,Delivery:delivery,'Actual dose / rate':'','Dose units':'Not entered',Route:'Not entered','Weight basis (snapshot)':`${state.run['Weight (kg)']||'Unknown'} kg; ${state.run['Weight basis']}`});}
