function bodyLabel(id,view=physicalView){if(view==='Posterior'){if(id==='chest')return 'Upper back';if(id==='abdomen')return 'Lower back';if(id==='pelvis')return 'Buttocks / pelvis';}return bodyRegions.find(r=>r[0]===id)?.[1]||'';}
function physicalAssessmentHTML(){const previous=effective().filter(e=>e.type==='Physical assessment'&&e.data.View===physicalView);return `<div class="section-heading"><div><h2>Physical assessment</h2><p class="muted">Tap a body region, then a finding to log it. Add specifics in the event log.</p></div></div><div class="body-view" role="group" aria-label="Body view">${['Anterior','Posterior'].map(v=>`<button data-body-view="${v}" aria-pressed="${physicalView===v}">${v==='Anterior'?'Front':'Back'}</button>`).join('')}</div><div class="body-assessment"><div class="body-map"><p>${physicalView==='Anterior'?'Front · palms forward':'Back'} · patient’s right / left</p><svg viewBox="0 0 300 540" role="group" aria-label="${physicalView} body regions"><text x="30" y="35">${physicalView==='Anterior'?'R':'L'}</text><text x="256" y="35">${physicalView==='Anterior'?'L':'R'}</text>${bodyRegions.map(([id,,path])=>{const last=previous.filter(e=>e.data['Region ID']===id).at(-1);const label=bodyLabel(id);return `<g role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="${esc(label)}${last?' — '+esc(last.data.Finding):''}" data-body-region="${id}" class="body-region ${last?'assessed':''}" ${physicalView==='Posterior'?'transform="translate(300 0) scale(-1 1)"':''}><title>${esc(label)}</title><path d="${path}"/></g>`;}).join('')}</svg><p class="muted">Highlighted = finding recorded for this view. Unmarked regions are not documented.</p></div><div class="body-region-list" aria-label="Body regions">${bodyRegions.map(([id])=>{const last=previous.filter(e=>e.data['Region ID']===id).at(-1);return `<button data-body-region="${id}"><strong>${esc(bodyLabel(id))}</strong><small>${last?esc(last.data.Finding)+' · '+clock(last.t):'Not documented'}</small></button>`;}).join('')}</div></div>`;}
function recordPhysical(region,view,finding){if(!bodyRegions.some(r=>r[0]===region)||!['Anterior','Posterior'].includes(view)||!physicalFindings.includes(finding))throw Error('Choose a valid body region and finding.');recordFast('Physical assessment',{'Region ID':region,Region:bodyLabel(region,view),View:view,Finding:finding});}
function openPhysicalRegion(region){if(!canRecord())return;const view=physicalView;if(!bodyRegions.some(r=>r[0]===region))return;showDialog(`${bodyLabel(region,view)} · ${view}`,`<p class="notice">Tap a finding to record it now. Only this region and view will be documented. Add location specifics or other details afterward.</p><div class="physical-findings">${physicalFindings.map(f=>`<button type="button" data-physical-finding="${esc(f)}">${esc(f)}</button>`).join('')}</div>`);$('#dialog .modal-foot .primary').hidden=true;$('#entry-form').onsubmit=e=>e.preventDefault();document.querySelectorAll('[data-physical-finding]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{const actor=$('#entry-form').elements['Team member'];if(actor)state.activeActor=actor.value;recordPhysical(region,view,b.dataset.physicalFinding);$('#dialog').close();modalContext=null;});}

function tabHTML(){const c=activeCPR();if(state.tab==='Patient weight')return patientWeightHTML();if(state.tab==='Physical assessment')return physicalAssessmentHTML();if(state.tab==='Finish details'){const pending=effective().filter(e=>e.data['Quick entry']&&e.data['Details status']!=='Added');return `<div class="section-heading"><h2>Finish details (${pending.length})</h2><button data-tab="Interventions">Back to live log</button></div><p class="notice">Events are already logged. Add known details without changing their original time.</p>${pending.length?pending.map(e=>`<article class="pending-row"><div><time>${clock(e.t)}</time><h3>${esc(eventTitle(e))}</h3>${actorBadge(e)}</div><button data-detail="${e.id}">Add details</button></article>`).join(''):'<p>No details waiting.</p>'}`;}if(state.tab==='Interventions')return fastWorkspace();
 if(state.tab==='H’s & T’s')return `<div class="section-heading"><div><h2>Reversible causes</h2><p class="muted">Evidence, treatment and response remain linked to the timeline.</p></div></div><div class="cause-grid">${causes.map((c,i)=>{const last=effective().filter(e=>e.type==='Reversible cause'&&e.data.Cause===c[1]).at(-1);return `<button class="cause" data-cause="${i}"><span class="cause-letter">${c[0]}</span><span><strong>${esc(c[1])}</strong><small>${i===5?'Explicit pediatric cause · ':''}${esc(last?.data.Status||'Not assessed')}</small></span></button>`;}).join('')}</div>`;
 if(state.tab==='Post-ROSC')return `<div class="section-heading"><h2>After circulation returns</h2></div><div class="reference-box"><strong>${state.run.Mode==='Adult'?'Adult post-arrest reference':'Pediatric post-arrest care'}</strong><p>${state.run.Mode==='Adult'?'Once measurement is reliable: SpO2 90–98%; PaCO2 generally 35–45 mm Hg; MAP at least 65 mm Hg. Record the treating team’s targets and actual values.':'Record age-appropriate blood pressure and oxygenation / ventilation targets selected by the treating team. Adult MAP targets are not applied.'}</p><p>Continue cause-directed care, neurologic / seizure assessment and temperature management. Record each ROSC and rearrest.</p></div><div class="action-grid">${action('Post-ROSC assessment','Vitals, targets & organ support','⌁')}${action('Lab / investigation','Specimen, result & action','+')}${action('Rearrest','Tap to record · details later','↻','','quick-rearrest')}</div>`;
 if(state.tab==='Handoff')return `<div class="section-heading"><h2>Close the loop</h2><span class="badge dark">${state.end?'CLOSED':'IN PROGRESS'}</span></div><div class="action-grid">${action('Handoff / closure','Outcome, rationale & receiving team','✓')}${action('Debrief','Separate quality-review observations','≡')}${action('Export PDF','Complete log & amendment history','↓','','export')}</div><div class="support-strip"><strong>Export a lasting copy.</strong><span>This browser saves the current run on this device. Export PDF before starting a new run or clearing browser data.</span></div><div class="secondary-actions">${state.end?'<button data-action="reopen">Reopen run</button>':''}<button class="danger-outline" data-action="clear">Clear run &amp; start new</button></div>`;
 return referenceHTML();}
function referenceHTML(){return `<div class="section-heading"><h2>2025 AHA reference</h2><span class="muted">${esc(state.run.Mode)}</span></div><p class="notice">Testing build · Independent clinical validation pending. These summaries and calculators support a trained clinician’s selected treatment; they are not orders or an AHA-endorsed product. Neonatal resuscitation at birth is outside scope.</p><details class="ref-section" open><summary>LIFEPAK 15 device profile</summary><p>Biphasic · maximum 360 J. Adult VF/pVT manufacturer sequence: 200 → 300 → 360 J. This is separate from rhythm-specific synchronized cardioversion energy. Follow your local protocol and the actual device configuration.</p><p>Available manual energy settings: ${LIFEPAK15.energies.join(", ")} J. For pediatric weight-based references, select an available setting according to your protocol; the app does not round automatically.</p><p>These prompts do not connect to or control the monitor.</p>${lifepakHTML("Synchronized cardioversion")}${lifepakHTML("Pacing")}<a href="${sources[11][1]}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Manufacturer energy reference (online)</a></details><details class="ref-section"><summary>CPR &amp; ventilation</summary><p>Compression rate 100–120/min, full recoil, minimal interruption; change compressor about every 2 minutes.</p><p>${state.run.Mode==='Adult'?'Adult depth at least 5 cm, avoiding >6 cm. Without advanced airway, 30:2. With advanced airway: continuous compressions and 10 breaths/min.':'Pediatric depth at least one-third chest AP diameter. Without advanced airway: single rescuer 30:2; two rescuers, prepubertal 15:2 and postpubertal 30:2. With advanced airway: 20–30 breaths/min during continuous compressions.'}</p><p>Visible chest rise; avoid overventilation. Waveform capnography confirms and monitors endotracheal tube placement.</p></details>${Object.entries(drugs).map(([g,ds])=>`<details class="ref-section"><summary>${esc(g)}</summary>${ds.map(d=>{const r=doseReference(g,d,state.run.Mode,state.run['Weight (kg)'],1);return `<div class="drug-ref"><h3>${esc(d)}</h3><p>${esc(r.text)} ${r.dose!==null?`Reference first dose: ${fmt(r.dose)} ${r.unit}.`:r.range?`${fmt(r.range[0])}–${fmt(r.range[1])} ${r.unit}.`:''} ${esc(r.calculation)}</p><button class="small" data-med="${esc(d)}" data-group="${esc(g)}">Open medication entry</button></div>`;}).join('')}</details>`).join('')}<details class="ref-section"><summary>Source documents &amp; app behavior</summary><p>${VERSION}. Embedded summaries and calculations work offline. Source links require internet.</p>${sources.map(([n,url])=>`<p><a href="${url}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">${esc(n)}</a></p>`).join('')}<p>Application files are cached for offline use. The current run, team roster and display preference are saved in IndexedDB on this device. No run data is sent to a server. Clearing browser data removes the local copy. This does not prevent identifiers being typed into free-text fields; keep entries non-identifying.</p><p>Timers use this device’s clock. Keep the screen awake: browser backgrounding may delay visual reminders. Reminders never document an action automatically.</p></details>`;}

function currentRhythmPrompt(){if(clockAlert||storageConflict)return null;return rhythmPrompt(state.run.Mode,effective(),state.end);}
function lifepakHTML(therapy){const steps=lifepakSteps(therapy);return steps.length?`<details class="lifepak-guide"><summary>LIFEPAK 15 · ${esc(therapy)}</summary><ol>${steps.map(s=>`<li>${esc(s)}</li>`).join('')}</ol><a href="${sources[10][1]}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Device instructions (online)</a></details>`:'';}
function algorithmHTML(){const p=currentRhythmPrompt();if(!p)return '';const e=p.event;return `<section class="algorithm-prompt" aria-label="Algorithmic prompt"><div class="algorithm-heading"><strong>2025 AHA · ${esc(state.run.Mode)} · LIFEPAK 15</strong><small>Based on ${esc(eventTitle(e))} · ${clock(e.t)}</small></div><h3>${esc(p.title)}</h3><p>${esc(p.text)}</p>${lifepakHTML(p.therapy||p.deviceTherapy)}${p.assess?`<div class="algorithm-choices"><button data-stability="unstable" data-assessment="${e.id}">Pulse present · unstable from rhythm</button><button data-stability="stable" data-assessment="${e.id}">Pulse present · stable</button><button data-stability="absent" data-assessment="${e.id}">Pulse absent</button><button data-stability="uncertain" data-assessment="${e.id}">Pulse present · cause uncertain</button></div>`:''}<div class="algorithm-actions"><button data-algorithm="reassess">Reassess rhythm / pulse</button>${p.therapy?`<button data-algorithm="electrical">Document ${p.therapy==='Defibrillation'?'defibrillation':'cardioversion'}</button>`:''}<a href="${sources[p.source][1]}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">AHA source (online)</a></div><small>Clinician reference · confirm current findings and device/local protocol. Treatment is logged only when you document it.</small></section>`;}
function recordPromptAssessment(id,choice){if(!canRecord())return;const p=currentRhythmPrompt();if(!p?.assess||p.event.id!==id)return;const opts={unstable:['Present','Compromise attributable to arrhythmia'],stable:['Present','Stable'],absent:['Absent','Unknown'],uncertain:['Present','Uncertain cause']};if(!opts[choice])return;const [Pulse,condition]=opts[choice];recordFast('Rhythm & pulse',{Rhythm:p.event.data.Rhythm,Pulse,'Hemodynamic condition':condition,'Prompt basis':'Current bedside assessment confirmed'});}
function wireAlgorithm(){document.querySelectorAll('[data-stability]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>recordPromptAssessment(b.dataset.assessment,b.dataset.stability));document.querySelectorAll('[data-algorithm]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{if(b.dataset.algorithm==='reassess')return openFastPicker('rhythm');const p=currentRhythmPrompt();if(!p?.therapy)return;openForm('Electrical therapy',{Therapy:p.therapy,Rhythm:p.event.data.Rhythm,Pulse:p.event.data.Pulse||'Unknown','Device adult maximum (J)':360,'Shock number':p.repeat?'':1,'Energy actually delivered (J)':'',Synchronization:p.therapy==='Synchronized cardioversion'?'Not confirmed':'Not applicable','Indication / device details':`Reference displayed: ${p.title}. Document actual delivered settings.`});});}
function refreshAlgorithm(){const target=$('#algorithm-panel');if(!target)return;const html=algorithmHTML();if(target._promptHTML===html)return;target._promptHTML=html;target.innerHTML=html;wireAlgorithm();}

function render(){const c=activeCPR(),r=runTiming(effective());$('#app').innerHTML=`<header><div class="brand"><span class="brandmark" aria-hidden="true">R</span><div>RESUS RECORD<small>Unified event documentation</small></div></div><div class="header-actions"><span class="badge">TEST BUILD</span><button class="danger-outline" data-action="clear-everything">Clear everything</button><button data-action="export">Export PDF</button></div></header><section class="runbar"><button class="run-name" data-action="details">${esc(state.run['Run name / number']||'Set up run')} <span aria-hidden="true">⌄</span></button><span class="mode-chip">${esc(state.run.Mode)}${state.run['Weight (kg)']?' · '+esc(state.run['Weight (kg)'])+' kg':''}</span><span class="device-chip">LIFEPAK 15 · biphasic</span><span id="offline-status">${offlineReady?'Offline ready':'Preparing offline access…'}</span><span><span id="save-status">${esc(saveMessage)}</span></span></section>${teamStrip()}<main class="${state.collapsed?'log-collapsed':''}"><nav class="section-sidebar" aria-label="Record sections">${['Interventions','Patient weight','Finish details','H’s & T’s','Physical assessment','Post-ROSC','Handoff','Reference'].map(t=>`<button class="${state.tab===t?'active':''}" data-tab="${esc(t)}" aria-current="${state.tab===t?'page':'false'}">${esc(t)}</button>`).join('')}</nav><section class="workspace ${state.start?'has-run':''}"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">LIVE WORKSPACE</p><h1>${state.end?'Run closed.':state.start?'Resuscitation record.':'Ready when you are.'}</h1></div>${!state.start?'<button class="primary" data-action="start">Start run</button>':'<button class="small" data-action="details">Run details</button>'}</div>${quickCPRHTML(c)}<div class="timers"><div class="timer run-timer"><span>RUN TIME</span><strong id="run-time">00:00</strong><button class="run-toggle" data-action="run-timer" ${state.end?'disabled':''}>${r.running?'Stop run timer':r.started?'Resume run timer':'Start run timer'}</button><small>${r.running?'Running':r.started?'Stopped · elapsed time retained':'Manual start'}</small></div><div class="timer ${c.active?'running':''}" id="cpr-timer"><span>${c.paused?'CPR PAUSE':'CPR CYCLE'}</span><strong id="cpr-time">02:00</strong><small id="cpr-caption">Start CPR to begin</small>${c.active?'<button class="timer-control" data-action="cycle">Reset cycle</button>':''}</div><button class="timer epi-given" id="epi-timer" data-action="fast-epi" aria-label="Epinephrine — choose arrest dose and route" ${state.end?'disabled':''}><span>LAST EPINEPHRINE</span><strong id="epi-time">—</strong><small id="epi-caption">No arrest bolus recorded</small><span class="timer-cta">+ Epinephrine dose & route</span></button></div><div id="clock-alert" class="notice warning" ${clockAlert?'':'hidden'}>Device clock changed. Verify event times and timers against the clinical clock.</div><div id="algorithm-panel"></div><div id="tab-content">${tabHTML()}</div></section><aside aria-label="Event log"><div class="section-heading"><h2>Event log <span class="count">${effective().length}</span></h2><button class="small" data-action="collapse" aria-expanded="${!state.collapsed}">${state.collapsed?'Show log':'Collapse'}</button></div>${quickReceipt()}<div class="log-content">${listHTML()}</div><div class="log-bottom">Local clock · ${Intl.DateTimeFormat().resolvedOptions().timeZone}<br>Original entries and corrections retained in PDF.</div></aside></main><footer><span>2025 AHA reference · Clinical validation pending</span><span id="wake-status">${wake?'Screen wake lock active':'Keep this page open and screen awake'}</span></footer>`;wire();tick();autosave();}
function wire(){document.querySelectorAll('[data-catalog-med]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>openCatalogMedication(b.dataset.catalogMed));document.querySelectorAll('[data-med-search]').forEach(input=>input.oninput=()=>{const q=input.value.trim().toLowerCase();document.querySelectorAll('[data-med-card]').forEach(card=>card.hidden=!card.textContent.toLowerCase().includes(q));});document.querySelectorAll('[data-body-view]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{physicalView=b.dataset.bodyView;render();});document.querySelectorAll('[data-body-region]').forEach(b=>{b.onclick=()=>openPhysicalRegion(b.dataset.bodyRegion);if(b.tagName.toLowerCase()==='g')b.onkeydown=e=>{if(e.key==='Enter'||e.key===' '){e.preventDefault();openPhysicalRegion(b.dataset.bodyRegion);}};});const weightForm=$('#patient-weight-form');if(weightForm){let weightTimer;weightForm.oninput=()=>{state.weightDraft={weight:$('#patient-weight-kg').value,basis:$('#patient-weight-basis').value};$('#patient-weight-status').textContent='Updating weight-based doses…';$('#weight-dose-preview').innerHTML='<p class="notice">Updating medication references…</p>';autosave();clearTimeout(weightTimer);weightTimer=setTimeout(()=>{if($('#patient-weight-form')===weightForm)applyWeight();},500);};const applyWeight=()=>{clearTimeout(weightTimer);if(!state.weightDraft&&$('#patient-weight-kg').value===state.run['Weight (kg)']&&$('#patient-weight-basis').value===state.run['Weight basis'])return;try{updatePatientWeight($('#patient-weight-kg').value,$('#patient-weight-basis').value,false);$('#patient-weight-status').textContent=`Doses updated automatically · ${state.run['Weight (kg)']} kg · ${state.run['Weight basis']}`;$('#weight-dose-preview').innerHTML=weightDosePreview();$('.mode-chip').textContent=`${state.run.Mode} · ${state.run['Weight (kg)']} kg`;$('.log-content').innerHTML=listHTML();$('aside .count').textContent=effective().length;wire();}catch(err){$('#patient-weight-status').textContent=err.message;$('#weight-dose-preview').innerHTML=weightDosePreview();}};weightForm.onchange=applyWeight;weightForm.onfocusout=applyWeight;weightForm.onsubmit=e=>{e.preventDefault();applyWeight();};}document.querySelectorAll('[data-dose-form]').forEach(form=>{form.oninput=()=>{const d=new FormData(form);state.doseDrafts[form.dataset.doseForm]={amount:d.get('amount'),units:d.get('units'),route:d.get('route')};autosave();};form.onsubmit=ev=>{ev.preventDefault();try{const d=new FormData(form);saveDose(form.dataset.doseForm,d.get('amount'),d.get('units'),d.get('route'));}catch(err){form.querySelector('.dose-error').textContent=err.message;}};});document.querySelectorAll('[data-actor]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{state.activeActor=b.dataset.actor;render();});document.querySelectorAll('[data-detail]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>openQuickDetails(b.dataset.detail));document.querySelectorAll('[data-undo]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>undoQuick(b.dataset.undo));document.querySelectorAll('[data-action]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>act(b.dataset.action,b.dataset.kind));document.querySelectorAll('[data-tab]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{if(state.weightDraft&&validWeight(state.weightDraft.weight)&&['Measured','Estimated'].includes(state.weightDraft.basis)){try{updatePatientWeight(state.weightDraft.weight,state.weightDraft.basis,false);}catch{}}state.tab=b.dataset.tab;render();});document.querySelectorAll('[data-cause]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>openCause(Number(b.dataset.cause)));document.querySelectorAll('[data-correct]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>openCorrection(b.dataset.correct));document.querySelectorAll('[data-med]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>openMedication({Context:b.dataset.group,Drug:b.dataset.med}));}
function act(a,k){if(a==='clear-everything')return openClearEverything();if(a==='run-timer')return toggleRunTimer();if(a.startsWith('pick-'))return openFastPicker(a.slice(5));if(a==='fast-shock')return recordFast('Electrical therapy',{Therapy:'Defibrillation','Energy actually delivered (J)':'',Rhythm:'Not entered'});if(a==='fast-epi')return openDosePresets('Epinephrine');if(a==='fast-note')return recordFast('Note',{});if(a==='team')return openTeam();if(['cpr-start','cpr-pause','cpr-stop','quick-rosc','quick-rearrest','compressor'].includes(a))return quickAction(a);if(a==='form')return openForm(k);if(a==='med')return openMedication();if(a==='details')return openForm('Run details');if(a==='start')return startRun();if(a==='collapse'){state.collapsed=!state.collapsed;render();return;}if(a==='export')return downloadPDF();if(a==='clear'){showDialog('Clear this run?',`<p class="notice warning">Starting a new run replaces the saved run on this device and clears its weight, timers, and clinical events. Team names, colors, and display preference stay. Export the PDF first.</p><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" required> I have exported the PDF or intentionally want to discard this run.</label>`,'Clear run');$('#entry-form').onsubmit=e=>{e.preventDefault();state=freshRun(state,initial());quickTaps.clear();lastPDF=null;$('#dialog').close();modalContext=null;render();};return;}
 if(a==='reopen'){state.end=null;append('Run reopened');return;}if(!canRecord())return;if(a==='cycle')append('CPR cycle reset',{'Meaning':'Timing checkpoint only; no assessment inferred','Recorder initials':state.run['Recorder initials']});}

function tick(){refreshAlgorithm();const now=Date.now(),c=activeCPR();if($('#run-time'))$('#run-time').textContent=duration(runTiming(effective(),state.end||now).elapsed);if($('#cpr-time')){$('#cpr-time').textContent=c.active?duration(Math.abs(120000-(now-c.cycle))):c.paused?duration(now-c.paused):'02:00';$('#cpr-caption').textContent=c.active?(now-c.cycle>=120000?'2 minutes reached · assess cycle':'Until 2-minute checkpoint'):c.paused?'Interruption in progress':'Start CPR to begin';$('#cpr-timer').classList.toggle('due',c.active&&now-c.cycle>=120000);}
 const epi=latestEpi();if($('#epi-time')){$('#epi-time').textContent=epi?duration((state.end||now)-epi.t):'—';$('#epi-caption').textContent=epi?(now-epi.t>=300000?'5 minutes elapsed · reassess':now-epi.t>=180000?'3–5 min reference window':'Since last recorded arrest bolus'):'No current arrest bolus recorded';$('#epi-timer').classList.toggle('due',!!epi&&now-epi.t>=180000&&!state.end);}
 if(Math.abs((now-wall)-(performance.now()-mono))>5000){clockAlert=true;if($('#clock-alert'))$('#clock-alert').hidden=false;}wall=now;mono=performance.now();}
async function requestWake(){try{if('wakeLock'in navigator&&!wake){wake=await navigator.wakeLock.request('screen');wake.addEventListener('release',()=>{wake=null;if($('#wake-status'))$('#wake-status').textContent='Keep this page open and screen awake';});if($('#wake-status'))$('#wake-status').textContent='Screen wake lock active';}}catch{}}
async function downloadPDF(){if(Object.keys(state.doseDrafts).length){toast('Save the dose entered in the event log before exporting.');return;}if(!state.events.length){toast('Record a run before exporting.');return;}if(modalContext?.dirty){toast('Record or discard the open entry before exporting.');return;}try{toast('Preparing complete PDF…');const bytes=await exportPDF(structuredClone(state),structuredClone(effective()));if(lastPDF)URL.revokeObjectURL(lastPDF);lastPDF=URL.createObjectURL(new Blob([bytes],{type:'application/pdf'}));const a=document.createElement('a');a.href=lastPDF;a.download=`resus-${(state.run['Run name / number']||'run').replace(/[^a-z0-9_-]/gi,'_')}-${new Date().toISOString().slice(0,10)}.pdf`;a.click();toast('PDF prepared. Confirm it is saved before closing the run.');}catch(e){toast('PDF export failed: '+e.message);}}
window.addEventListener('beforeunload',e=>{if(savePending||storageConflict||(!sessionStore&&state.events.length)||modalContext?.dirty){e.preventDefault();e.returnValue='';}});
document.addEventListener('visibilitychange',()=>{if(document.visibilityState==='visible'){tick();if(state.start&&!state.end)requestWake();}});
window.addEventListener('pageshow',e=>{if(e.persisted){tick();storageStatus();}});
$('#app').innerHTML='<p class="notice">Opening saved run…</p>';initializeSession();setInterval(tick,250);
if('serviceWorker'in navigator){navigator.serviceWorker.register('./sw.js',{updateViaCache:'none'}).then(async()=>{await navigator.serviceWorker.ready;const cache=await caches.open('resus-shell-v22');offlineReady=!!(await cache.match(new URL('./index.html',location.href)));if(storageReady)render();}).catch(()=>{if($('#offline-status'))$('#offline-status').textContent='Offline setup failed · keep connected';});}else $('#offline-status').textContent='Offline reload unavailable in this browser';
// The agent interface exposes only navigation, never clinical actions or doses.
if(document.modelContext?.registerTool){try{Promise.resolve(document.modelContext.registerTool({name:'open_record_section',title:'Open record section',description:'Navigate to an existing record section without recording a clinical event.',inputSchema:{type:'object',properties:{section:{type:'string',enum:['Interventions','Patient weight','Finish details','H’s & T’s','Physical assessment','Post-ROSC','Handoff','Reference']}},required:['section'],additionalProperties:false},annotations:{readOnlyHint:false,untrustedContentHint:false},execute(input){if(!input||Object.keys(input).some(k=>k!=='section')||!['Interventions','Patient weight','Finish details','H’s & T’s','Physical assessment','Post-ROSC','Handoff','Reference'].includes(input.section))throw Error('Unknown section');if($('#dialog').open)throw Error('Complete or cancel the open entry first');state.tab=input.section;render();return{section:state.tab};}})).catch(()=>{});}catch{}}
